# Cloudflare Pages redirect rules
# Canonicalise everything to https://www.stepsmedical.com.au
# (Cloudflare Pages serves *.pages.dev and any custom domain on the same
# deployment; these rules stop the apex/bare domain and the pages.dev
# preview URL from competing with the canonical www URL in search.)

https://stepsmedical.com.au/*  https://www.stepsmedical.com.au/:splat  301!
http://stepsmedical.com.au/*   https://www.stepsmedical.com.au/:splat  301!
http://www.stepsmedical.com.au/*  https://www.stepsmedical.com.au/:splat  301!
